17:["$","p","1",{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":"Claim scrubbing runs claims against a rules engine before submission — checking code validity, required modifiers, diagnosis-to-procedure linkage, NCCI edits, and payer-specific requirements. Every error it catches is an error that never becomes a denial."}]
